  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Twain looks in the mirror. \n \nIt\u2019s new and cheap, like all the
    other ones which have been installed in regular intervals across the barracks.They
    are nothing special. Serviceable. \n\nHe gives himself a good look. His uniform
    is not impeccable, but it is still within regulations. black eyes with bags under
    them, the consequence of one too many nights poring over books. Joining the Clubs,
    the Order\u2019s research division, has been his goal for so long that now that
    he\u2019s accomplished it he feels a bit lost.\n\nTwain moves his hand up to
    adjust his lapel and his reflection follows, after which he passes a thin comb
    through black locks and tames the worst of his bed hair.\n\nServiceable, for
    a first day. He hopes it will be enough. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: af1df4cc76be3d341b221fb1ca95433f, type: 2}
